{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-tree-view",
  "category": "isp",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-tree-view&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "description": "Árbol editable ISP (port TreeRowView): drag, historial y ficha.",
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-tree-view",
  "hasBehavior": true,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Port de <code class=\"code\">TreeRowView</code> (ClientesIS). No es <code class=\"code\">&lt;iswc-tree&gt;</code>:",
        "          este sí muta, arrastra y guarda historial. El consumidor pasa <code class=\"code\">list</code> +",
        "          <code class=\"code\">customs</code> (mapeo <code class=\"code\">iplan</code> ↔ <code class=\"code\">flatPath</code>)."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "html": [
            "Toolbar: agregar raíz, expandir/colapsar, deshacer / proteger / rehacer.",
            "          Hover en una fila muestra mover / agregar hijo. Doble clic abre el drawer."
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-tree-view id=\"tvDemo\" label-field=\"titulo\" style=\"height: 28rem;\">",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"list\": [",
            "                  { \"iplan\": \"1\", \"titulo\": \"Módulo 1\", \"children\": [",
            "                    { \"iplan\": \"1.1\", \"titulo\": \"Introducción\" },",
            "                    { \"iplan\": \"1.2\", \"titulo\": \"Conceptos básicos\" }",
            "                  ]},",
            "                  { \"iplan\": \"2\", \"titulo\": \"Módulo 2\", \"children\": [",
            "                    { \"iplan\": \"2.1\", \"titulo\": \"Lección 1\" },",
            "                    { \"iplan\": \"2.2\", \"titulo\": \"Lección 2\" }",
            "                  ]}",
            "                ],",
            "                \"customs\": {",
            "                  \"iplan\": \"flatPath\"",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-tree-view>",
            "          <p id=\"tvLog\">Última acción: <code class=\"code\">—</code></p>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:label-field",
              "label": "label-field"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
    "sections": {
      "anatomia": {
        "content": [
          "Port de <code class=\"code\">TreeRowView</code> (ClientesIS). No es <code class=\"code\">&lt;iswc-tree&gt;</code>:",
          "          este sí muta, arrastra y guarda historial. El consumidor pasa <code class=\"code\">list</code> +",
          "          <code class=\"code\">customs</code> (mapeo <code class=\"code\">iplan</code> ↔ <code class=\"code\">flatPath</code>)."
        ]
      },
      "ejemplos": {
        "content": [
          "```js",
          "// Equivalente: pasar `list` y `customs` por JSON al host.",
          "// El componente lee el <script type=\"application/json\"> como spec",
          "// y aplica la configuración al upgrade.",
          "tv.list = [...];",
          "tv.customs = new PlanCustoms();",
          "```"
        ]
      }
    },
    "exclude": [
      "apiJs",
      "atributos",
      "eventos",
      "parts",
      "props",
      "slots",
      "states"
    ]
  }
}